+// Framebuffers hold views of the textures (Vulkan's depth attachment view
+// reads its texture on destruction), so they must go first. A plain
+// `t = Targets{}` move-assigns in declaration order: textures, then
+// framebuffers, a use-after-free on the second resize.
+void release_targets(Targets& t) {
+    t.main.reset();
+    t.final.reset();
+    t = Targets{};
+}
+
